{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Prevent self-starvation when executors are shared.** Result serialization runs on user-executor threads. If `withPayloadOffloadExecutorService` is set to the same bounded executor, workers block here waiting for queued offload tasks that cannot start, hanging the execution. Reject shared executor instances or avoid synchronous submit-and-join, and add a bounded-pool regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7obao_","finding_digest":"0bf391526eb3899f8d32ceb5f9427bfeb0598f57a160bc33533a702297e3b85d","finding_id":"arf_v1_bpzzcutowoez7djsz227sqt372","finding_key":"sdk/execution/payloadcodec::runoffloadtask::executor-self-starvation","identity_key":"sdk/execution/payloadcodec::runoffloadtask::executor-self-starvation","line":154,"observation_digest":"df0e264d193d372cdca70e741426e622d06fd1b72046b10ebce3125985364642","observation_id":"aro_v1_34hcmtizhu3szxfhbz2bijxgel","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/PayloadCodec.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-08-31T23:52:55Z","review_id":"arr_v1_6jkuiq4kchptxblgaj7rv7ox7x","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"596734db953690c8d41226cf4b84fde1a44d3066","reviewer":"codex","start_line":154,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_c4jyr3pazn4ia73j45uj627gaf","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-08-31T23:52:55Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
